WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.270
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is not allowed

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.500
to Speed Date!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.740
If you remember an event called SCP Speed
dating, please report to Site Command immediately

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.169
for your mandatory dose of Class A Amnestic.

00:00:13.169 --> 00:00:16.970
This event never officially took place, and
there is no public record of it.

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:21.390
Dr. Bright certainly did not pack the canteen
with safe-class humanoid SCPs and employees

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:25.300
of the Foundation, and ding a bell every five
minutes so that eligible singles could switch

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.329
tables and meet someone new.

00:00:27.329 --> 00:00:31.390
There were no public displays of affection
on Foundation grounds, and certainly no ensuing

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:34.640
disastrous dates at any local Italian restaurants.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.860
Dr. Bright is not allowed to organize a speed
dating event ever again.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:42.230
Um, I mean, for the first time.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.210
Because there has never been one.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.210
Not here.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:45.640
No sir.

